# Test: the built le entry point exposes GitHub reporting/preview and refuses ambiguous inputs.
# QUESTION: does the developer's le binary link the GitHub owner, publish its
# declared help, and return the usage code for absent, conflicting and malformed
# selectors before any API request? A package unit cannot decide whether the
# product composition root linked this owner or whether its public parser and
# shared renderer route the words to the same handler.
# VALIDATES: github-development-integration AC-1/2/8 entry-point registration and
# input refusal. Successful paginated API reads and shared formats are exercised
# through the same production action factory with a fixture transport in the
# github package; this functional test adds no API-origin override.
# PREVENTS: an unlinked report owner, help-only stub, or malformed selector
# falling through to network work or a successful empty response.

option=timeout:value=180s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le help github report:exit=0
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=revision
expect=stdout:contains=run
expect=stdout:contains=machine

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=le github report:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2
expect=stderr:contains=exactly one selector
expect=stderr:contains=fix:

cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=le github report revision short:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2
expect=stderr:contains=full 40-character commit ID
reject=stderr:contains=HTTP

cmd=foreground:seq=4:exec=le github report revision 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567 run 7:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2
expect=stderr:contains=exactly one selector

cmd=foreground:seq=5:exec=le github report run 0:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2
expect=stderr:contains=must be positive

cmd=foreground:seq=6:exec=le github report machine run 7:exit=2
expect=stderr:contains=cannot select a GitHub run
expect=exit:code=2

cmd=foreground:seq=7:exec=le help github preview:exit=0
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=run
expect=stdout:contains=destination
expect=stdout:contains=preview

cmd=foreground:seq=8:exec=le github preview run 0 destination pending-owner-approval:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2
expect=stderr:contains=invalid GitHub report selector
expect=stderr:contains=No message was sent
reject=stderr:contains=HTTP

cmd=foreground:seq=9:exec=le github preview run malformed destination pending-owner-approval:exit=2
expect=exit:code=2
expect=stderr:contains=cannot take "malformed" as run <run-id>
expect=stderr:contains=unsigned decimal integer
reject=stderr:contains=HTTP
